                <pb facs="0658" n="560" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg560"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2904: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Harrison</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-07-29T12:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 29,
                                1920—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 2:49 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>1463. Reference your telegram to London which was repeated to me giving text of
                    proposed joint announcement on August 1st by the four powers concerning the
                    establishment of consortium.<anchor n="70" xml:id="d547-f1"/> Foreign Office
                    will make similar announcement on August 1st.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
